WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:06.942
Availability cover and concerns 9 Availability and cover Daniel's

00:00:06.942 --> 00:00:12.390
fictional normal support period is 08:00 to 17:00 This is a

00:00:12.469 --> 00:00:17.442
case fact not an employment recommendation Any planned work

00:00:17.482 --> 00:00:22.192
outside that period requires an agreed arrangement Aisha is

00:00:22.245 --> 00:00:26.034
the appointed deputy for accepted cover periods using her

00:00:26.061 --> 00:00:30.732
own authorised access The control room's monitoring coverage is

00:00:30.824 --> 00:00:33.837
separately defined and does not depend on Daniel personally

00:00:33.903 --> 00:00:37.824
watching a phone after work Neither the existence of

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.916
Aisha nor the word deputy means that she has

00:00:40.969 --> 00:00:47.153
accepted every future assignment 10 Concerns and unresolved decisions

00:00:48.086 --> 00:00:51.810
Routine priority conflicts go to Lindiwe or the designated

00:00:51.889 --> 00:00:58.219
substitute decision-maker Concerns involving personal safety improper conduct or

00:00:58.271 --> 00:01:02.219
the executive herself have an alternative organisational reporting route

00:01:02.298 --> 00:01:07.297
identified in the controlled contact register Daniel reports missing

00:01:07.337 --> 00:01:11.587
authority information or service acceptance with the consequence and

00:01:11.653 --> 00:01:16.153
the decision required Essential emergency help is not delayed

00:01:16.179 --> 00:01:21.534
to complete a routine administrative approval chain 11 Handover

00:01:21.561 --> 00:01:26.626
and continuing activity A handover identifies the current plan

00:01:26.995 --> 00:01:33.008
open decisions commitments information location relevant service acceptance and

00:01:33.087 --> 00:01:38.784
the named incoming owner That person confirms acceptance The

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:42.140
outgoing and incoming roles are recorded separately from the

00:01:42.192 --> 00:01:47.153
control room's ongoing responsibilities If cover is not accepted

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:51.100
Daniel escalates to the duty manager or designated owner

00:01:51.482 --> 00:01:55.350
the unresolved obligation is not silently closed or indefinitely

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:57.021
assigned to him by default
